## Overview

`markdown` provides a server-side `Bun.markdown` compiler and a matching React renderer. The compiler escapes raw HTML, restricts link and image URLs, and extracts fenced code for rendering through the shared `CodeBlock`.

## Usage

```tsx
const compiled = compileMarkdown(source);

<MarkdownContent
  html={compiled.html}
  codeBlocks={compiled.codeBlocks}
/>
```
